  --foreground, --no-detach  Run attached to current shell (default is detached)
  --detach                   Run detached (default)
  --extra                    Allow launching a new instance even if one is already running
  --precompile               Compile the source if it is newer than the binary, then exit without
                             launching. Safe to run while an instance is live (the build is renamed
                             into place). The in-app updater uses this so a restart is instant
